 "operationalization": {
  "rules": [
   "baseline: 5min CISD (series_open, 2/2, max_wait 3, min_series 1), decide at the confirming close, enter next M1 open, stop at the protected swing, 2R, hold 50min",
   "POIs marked at the 18:00 NY day open: unfilled 1h three-bar FVGs formed in the last 24 1h bars (near edge) + previous day's high/low; only levels on the far side of the day's open price",
